# Backend environment example

Copy to `backend/.env` if you need overrides (optional — defaults work locally).

```bash
# DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./data/salary.db
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5433/salary_management

CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:8080
FX_API_BASE=https://api.frankfurter.dev/v1
FX_CACHE_SECONDS=3600
FX_DEFAULT_BASE=USD
SEED_EMPLOYEE_COUNT=10000
```
